  <trk>
    <name>Segnes Trail</name>
    <desc>After the climb with the FlemX, you get straight down to business: the start of the Segnestrail winds its way over rocky steps to a first intermediate plateau. From there, it gets smoother – and faster! When you arrive in Startgels, you&apos;ll have a big grin on your face.</desc>
    <type>mountainbiking</type>
